        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kendrick Lamar, DJ Dahi, Drake, Jay Rock\n- Products: “Money Trees”, Good Kid, M.A.A.D City, Section.80, “Worst Behavior”\n- Roles: American hip hop recording artist, American rapper, Canadian rapper, producer\n\nFacts:\n- In 2011, Kendrick Lamar released his debut studio album Section.80 exclusively through the iTunes Store as an independent album.\n- In 2012, Kendrick Lamar released Good Kid, M.A.A.D City as his second studio album.\n- Good Kid, M.A.A.D City was preceded by Kendrick Lamar’s debut studio album Section.80.\n- “Money Trees” is a song by American hip hop recording artist Kendrick Lamar from his major-label debut studio album Good Kid, M.A.A.D City.\n- DJ Dahi is known for producing Drake’s song “Worst Behavior.”\n- DJ Dahi also produced Kendrick Lamar’s album track “Money Trees,” which features Jay Rock.",
